<title>BELGIUM: Banque de Luxembourg 1996 profit up nine percent.</title>
<headline>Banque de Luxembourg 1996 profit up nine percent.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996 (in billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	     1.13  vs  1.03</p>
<p>    Dividend (francs)	 17,750  vs  up 12 percent</p>
<p>    Total assets		   253  vs  up 4.7 percent</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque de Luxembourg shareholders are Credit Industriel d'Alsace et de Lorraine, Deutsche Bank Luxembourg SA and Deutsche Bank Saar AG.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
